t-align: center;\">4</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\">15ᵗʰ</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">+5</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">@UUID[Compendium.a5e-martial-artistry.class-features.Item.BJg0OumlpXRkw2PG]{Coordinated Assault}</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">9</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">4ᵗʰ</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">6</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">4</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\">16ᵗʰ</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">+5</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.izdnt7eqytkwgb1d]{Ability Score Improvement}</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">10</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">4ᵗʰ</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">7</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">5</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\">17ᵗʰ</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">+6</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">Archetype Ability</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">10</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">4ᵗʰ</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">7</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">5</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\">18ᵗʰ</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">+6</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.38eHFIsKOkXmUeQh]{Sacrifice}</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">11</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">4ᵗʰ</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">7</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">5</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\">19ᵗʰ</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">+6</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.izdnt7eqytkwgb1d]{Ability Score Improvement}</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">11</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">5ᵗʰ</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">8</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">5</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\">20ᵗʰ</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">+6</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.YOVjPHmYK8S6E0IK]{Legendary Sentinel}</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">12</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">5ᵗʰ</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">12</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">5</td></tr></tbody></table><h3><br>Hit Points</h3><p><strong>Hit Dice:</strong> 1d8 per sentinel level</p><p><strong>Hit Points at 1st Level:</strong> 8 + your Constitution modifier</p><p><strong>Hit Points at Higher Levels:</strong> 1d8 (or 5) + your Constitution modifier per sentinel level after 1st</p><h3>Proficiencies</h3><p><strong>Armor:</strong> Light Armor, Medium Armor, Heavy Armor, and Shields</p><p><strong>Weapons:</strong> Simple Weapons, Martial Weapons</p><p><strong>Saving Throws:</strong> Constitution, Charisma</p><p><strong>Skills:</strong> Persuasion, and choose two from Acrobatics, Animal Handling, Athletics, History, Insight, Intimidation, Perception, and Survival</p><h3>Equipment</h3><p>You start with 225gp which you can spend on your character’s starting weapons, armor, and adventuring gear. You can choose ala carte or take one of the starting packages below:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Guard’s Set (Cost 107 gold):</strong> Longbow and 20 arrows, pike, shortsword, medium shield, padded leather, backpack, bell, lantern (standard), manacles, signal whistle</p></li><li><p><strong>Skirmisher’s Set (Cost 193 gold):</strong> 6 javelins, longsword, hauberk, light shield, explorer’s pack</p></li><li><p><strong>Wandering Warrior’s set (Cost 200 gold):</strong> Longsword, hauberk, medium shield, explorer’s pack</p></li></ul>",
